    "name": "Emblem of Valor",
    "steam_appid": 1864830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emblem of Valor is a roguelike deck-building game featureing party-based combat with multiple characters and classes.<br><br>The Shattered Realm is facing an unprecedented crisis \u2013 the emerging Voidmist is gradually eroding the barriers between realms, bringing a deadly threat of countless Void creatures. The last guardian has summoned lost heroes to make a final stand. Assemble your team and build your deck to save this shattered realm before it's too late.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/c2383f904e86233ff89b3cda396f3a07.poster.avif?t=1742810564\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/c2383f904e86233ff89b3cda396f3a07.webm?t=1742810564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/c2383f904e86233ff89b3cda396f3a07.mp4?t=1742810564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/d0e0e23fd6b3f6272b88cdba4d0af4a5.avif?t=1742810564\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your character from five distinct classes - Warrior, Mage, Cleric, Ranger, and Rogue. Each class features unique card types, along with class-specific abilities, allowing players to create powerful combos. You can also recruit up to two companions into your party, integrating cards from their classes into your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to party combinations, each character has the potential to take on multiple classes - the same card can trigger different effects when played by different characters. You can even have multiple characters team up to play a single card, demonstrating the power of cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stick to a single pure class and specialize, or combine different classes to open up richer tactics - the possibilities are endless for creating the perfect deck for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/60655cb3e8a23df2376853daf4fb416c.avif?t=1742810564\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shattered Realm contains ever-shifting environments with different spatial fragments intersecting, all permeated by dangers from the Void. Your adventure will traverse multiple spatial fragments to complete missions, with dynamic stage options making each run unique. Carefully choose your path in each stage selection - more dangerous stages may yield richer rewards, but will also test your deck against greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from dynamic stages, monsters and events on the map are randomly generated in each playthrough. Special events also feature class-specific options, greatly increasing replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/bd677ec52f1340f8d5f71a36735bd200.avif?t=1742810564\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voidmist - the manifestation of the Void - is the most lethal danger in the Shattered Realm. It thirsts to siphon energy from souls, spawning Void creatures to hunt all life within its reach. As its density increases, it empowers those creatures with ever greater deadliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your journey, some maps allow freely moving and enable accumulating cards and equipments. However, the surrounding Voidmist also thickens gradually with time. Trigger all possible events and complete missions, or dash through the shortest path to reduce the threat of Voidmist. Choose wisely to prove your wisdom and valor in this perilous Shattered Realm!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emblem of Valor is a roguelike deck-building game featureing party-based combat with multiple characters and classes.<br><br>The Shattered Realm is facing an unprecedented crisis \u2013 the emerging Voidmist is gradually eroding the barriers between realms, bringing a deadly threat of countless Void creatures. The last guardian has summoned lost heroes to make a final stand. Assemble your team and build your deck to save this shattered realm before it's too late.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/c2383f904e86233ff89b3cda396f3a07.poster.avif?t=1742810564\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/c2383f904e86233ff89b3cda396f3a07.webm?t=1742810564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/c2383f904e86233ff89b3cda396f3a07.mp4?t=1742810564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/d0e0e23fd6b3f6272b88cdba4d0af4a5.avif?t=1742810564\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your character from five distinct classes - Warrior, Mage, Cleric, Ranger, and Rogue. Each class features unique card types, along with class-specific abilities, allowing players to create powerful combos. You can also recruit up to two companions into your party, integrating cards from their classes into your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to party combinations, each character has the potential to take on multiple classes - the same card can trigger different effects when played by different characters. You can even have multiple characters team up to play a single card, demonstrating the power of cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stick to a single pure class and specialize, or combine different classes to open up richer tactics - the possibilities are endless for creating the perfect deck for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/60655cb3e8a23df2376853daf4fb416c.avif?t=1742810564\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shattered Realm contains ever-shifting environments with different spatial fragments intersecting, all permeated by dangers from the Void. Your adventure will traverse multiple spatial fragments to complete missions, with dynamic stage options making each run unique. Carefully choose your path in each stage selection - more dangerous stages may yield richer rewards, but will also test your deck against greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from dynamic stages, monsters and events on the map are randomly generated in each playthrough. Special events also feature class-specific options, greatly increasing replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1864830/extras/bd677ec52f1340f8d5f71a36735bd200.avif?t=1742810564\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voidmist - the manifestation of the Void - is the most lethal danger in the Shattered Realm. It thirsts to siphon energy from souls, spawning Void creatures to hunt all life within its reach. As its density increases, it empowers those creatures with ever greater deadliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your journey, some maps allow freely moving and enable accumulating cards and equipments. However, the surrounding Voidmist also thickens gradually with time. Trigger all possible events and complete missions, or dash through the shortest path to reduce the threat of Voidmist. Choose wisely to prove your wisdom and valor in this perilous Shattered Realm!</p>",
